    <question><![CDATA[<h4><b>Design: “Directional Arrow”</b></h4>

<p>This design, called <b>“Directional Arrow”</b>, attempts to <b>indicate the autonomous vehicle’s intention to move forward</b>, using a projected arrow on the road. How clear is this interface in conveying its purpose?</p>

<p> </p>

<p><img src="/upload/surveys/687253/images/Arrow%20Mockup.png" style="width: 500px; max-width: 90%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;" /></p>
]]></question>
