    <question><![CDATA[<h4><b>Command: "Proceed"</b></h4>

<p>This voice command, called <strong>"Proceed"</strong>, tells the autonomous vehicle that it <b>may move forward</b>, confirming that it is safe to do so. How applicable do you think this voice command is for interacting with the autonomous vehicle?</p>

