    <question><![CDATA[<h4><b>Gesture: "Slow Down"</b></h4>

<p>This gesture, called <strong>"Slow Down"</strong>, requests the autonomous vehicle to <b>slow down and proceed cautiously</b> by moving both hands downward in a calming motion. How applicable do you think this gesture is for interacting with the autonomous vehicle?</p>

