    <title><![CDATA[gesture5]]></title>
    <question><![CDATA[<h4><b>Gesture: "Avoid Obstacle"</b></h4>

<p>This gesture, called <strong>"Avoid Obstacle"</strong>, instructs the autonomous vehicle to <b>go around an obstacle instead of stopping</b>. One hand points to the obstacle while the other makes a semi-circular motion to suggest going around. How applicable do you think this gesture is for interacting with the autonomous vehicle?</p>

<p> </p>

<p><img src="/upload/surveys/687253/images/Avoid-Obstacle.gif" style="width: 500px; max-width: 90%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;" /></p>

<p> </p>
]]></question>
