    <question><![CDATA[<h4><strong>Design: "Green Traffic Light"</strong></h4>

<p>This design, called <strong>"Green Traffic Light"</strong>, attempts to <strong>indicate that the autonomous vehicle is yielding and the pedestrian should proceed</strong>, using a virtual traffic light displaying a green signal. How clear is this interface in conveying its purpose?</p>

<p> </p>

<p><img src="/upload/surveys/687253/images/Intention%20Yield%20VTL%20Mockup.png" style="width: 500px; max-width: 90%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;" /></p>
]]></question>
