    <question><![CDATA[<h4><b>Gesture: "Follow Me"</b></h4>

<p>This gesture, called <strong>"Follow Me"</strong>, tells the autonomous vehicle to <b>follow the pedestrian</b>. The gesture consists of a beckoning motion with both hands. How applicable do you think this gesture is for interacting with the autonomous vehicle?</p>

<p> </p>

<p><img src="/upload/surveys/687253/images/Follow.gif" style="width: 500px; max-width: 90%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;" /></p>

<p> </p>
]]></question>
