    <question><![CDATA[<h4><b>Gesture: "Stop"</b></h4>

<p>This gesture, called <strong>"Stop"</strong>, instructs the autonomous vehicle to <b>stop immediately</b>. The gesture consists of raising one hand, palm facing forward, similar to a traffic officer’s stop signal. How applicable do you think this gesture is for interacting with the autonomous vehicle?</p>

<p> </p>

<p><img src="/upload/surveys/687253/images/Stop.gif" style="width: 500px; max-width: 90%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;" /></p>

<p> </p>
]]></question>
