    <question><![CDATA[<h4><b>Gesture: "Emergency Stop"</b></h4>

<p>This gesture, called <strong>"Emergency Stop"</strong>, signals an <strong>immediate and critical stop</strong>. The gesture consists of raising both arms, with palms extended facing the vehicle. How applicable do you think this gesture is for interacting with the autonomous vehicle?</p>

<p> </p>

<p><img src="/upload/surveys/687253/images/Emergency-Stop.gif" style="width: 500px; max-width: 90%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;" /></p>

<p> </p>
]]></question>
