  <rows>
   <row>
    <surveyls_survey_id><![CDATA[687253]]></surveyls_survey_id>
    <surveyls_language><![CDATA[en]]></surveyls_language>
    <surveyls_title><![CDATA[Multimodal Interactions with Autonomous Vehicles]]></surveyls_title>
    <surveyls_description/>
    <surveyls_welcometext><![CDATA[<p>Imagine walking through a city where autonomous vehicles (AVs) seamlessly communicate with pedestrians. Our study explores how Augmented Reality (AR), speech, and gestures can help you interact safely with AVs.</p>

<p>By participating, you will help shape the future of these interactions.</p>

<p>What to expect:</p>

<ul>
	<li>You will be presented with a series of interaction concepts in the form of videos or visual examples.</li>
	<li>You will rate these interactions individually and compare them with each other.</li>
	<li>You will have the opportunity to share your opinions and comments.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Estimated Duration:</strong> ~10 minutes</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Your feedback is essential to the success of our study and to advancing this innovative field of research.</p>
]]></surveyls_welcometext>
    <surveyls_endtext><![CDATA[<p>Thank you for completing our survey! Your contribution is invaluable in helping us understand and improve interactions with autonomous vehicles.</p>

<p>Do you have more ideas or comments on this topic? We would be thrilled to hear from you! Feel free to reach out to me at <a href="mailto:andreclerigo@ua.pt" target="_blank">andreclerigo@ua.pt</a>.</p>

<p>Once again, we deeply appreciate your time and insights!</p>

<p>Thank you again, and I hope we can count on you for future initiatives!</p>
]]></surveyls_endtext>
    <surveyls_url/>
    <surveyls_urldescription/>
